      "title": "A Century of Evidence on Trend-Following Investing",
      "authors": "Brian Hurst, Yao Hua Ooi, Lasse Heje Pedersen",
      "journal": "Journal of Portfolio Management",
      "url": "https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=2993026",
      "key_finding": "Blended 1/3/12 month TSMOM works in every decade since 1880. 67 markets, 4 asset classes. Crisis alpha in 8 of 10 largest drawdowns.",
